        <mxCell id="n7" value="Why a person, not an agent::
the platform's node configuration — image, start
command, capabilities, environment — is editable only
in the Nydus UI; its REST API cannot set it. Reading a
node's log window and opening a capture in Wireshark
are the same kind of work." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f9;strokeColor=#e3e5ea;fontColor=#3d3d46;fontSize=15.4;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="232" width="540" height="134" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
